      "statement": "The process entrypoint `src/cli/cli.tsx` installs a crash guard before any run, parses argv into a command, routes `integrations` and `mcp` commands to the host-integration surface, and dispatches all other commands to `runStandardCommand`, which loads environment, resolves the startup command, decides once whether this is the first run (mints the install id), then routes `link`, `workspace`, `auth`, `ngrok`, `cron`, `ingest`, and `visualize` directly to their own runners, and otherwise either prints a startup error, runs non-interactively in print mode, or renders the interactive Ink `App`.",
