      "statement": "Repository (code) generation follows the resumable page-job flow `begin → submit_plan → next_page → submit_page → … → finish` with a durable ordered page queue; in-progress runs are recorded in `openwiki/.run.json` so an interrupted run on a persistent checkout resumes, while ephemeral CI runners start fresh after failure unless their workspace is preserved.",
