    {
      "id": "claim_9e01e5570d7b44939297f2f884217852",
      "statement": "Each repository page job has a `PageJobStatus` of `pending`, `skipped`, or `complete`; `skipped` is a third durable status (distinct from `complete`) that records a page worker that failed or exited without calling `submit_page`, rolls the page back to its pre-worker state so completed pages are not lost, lets the run `finish` once every remaining job is `complete` or `skipped`, and is reset to `pending` when the run resumes.",
