    {
      "id": "claim_6370a8ed57d5435ab5b70466edf5ebc1",
      "statement": "A repository run's planner and page workers share one LangSmith thread so their otherwise-independent traces group as one planner plus one worker per page. The planner's DeepAgent is named \"planning agent\" (PLANNER_AGENT_NAME) and each page worker is named \"worker agent: <page>\" (workerAgentName derives the name from the canonical page path), and the shared thread id is resolved by resolveTraceThreadId(run.state.runId) and threaded into every agent.stream call. resolveTraceThreadId returns the trimmed OPENWIKI_TRACE_THREAD_ID env var when set and non-empty, otherwise the durable run.state.runId.",
